WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.310
Welcome to Las Vegas.

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:19.910
We were waiting for you, Secretary Douglas.

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:27.660
Clash! American Tournament Finals

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:35.680
As you can see, the present state of the PPB team's physical condition is at its best.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:37.840
What did the therapists say?

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:43.430
Their judgment is that the blader's
mental state is perfectly stable.

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:45.430
I see.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:50.890
Everything is in order.

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:54.320
I'm expecting great things from tomorrow's finals.

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:55.980
Worry not.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.350
Leave it to us.

00:02:57.350 --> 00:03:01.520
We assure you we will bring glory to the PPB.

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:06.400
Your victory will also serve as a proof of America's scientific proficiency.

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:09.200
Still, I gotta say...

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:17.170
I never thought <i>that</i> BBA team
would make it to the finals.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:19.120
Director.

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:23.270
What do you think about this?

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:26.440
Take a look at this.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:39.930
The victories they've earned thus far were a result of the favorable match-ups and their bio-rhythm.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.530
This is the result of my analysis.

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:46.780
In other words, they were blessed by luck and chance.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:53.120
Based on this data I performed a simulation of tomorrow's match. You can find it on the next page.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.490
I like this last sentence.

00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:04.110
"No matter what circumstances arises, the BBA team will lose against us."

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:11.190
Mama! I will fight against your PPB team with everything I have!

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:12.560
Look at me!

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:16.310
Director Judy?

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:17.910
What's wrong?

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:20.040
It's nothing.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.890
Anyway, in conclusion,

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:26.650
our absolute victory is guaranteed.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:45.640
What? I'm not fighting in the finals?!

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:48.310
<i>Why?</i> I'm super up to it!

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:50.090
That's right! Explain yourself!

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:54.100
Think about what kind of opponent the PPB is.

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:56.060
What kind of opponent..?

00:04:56.060 --> 00:05:02.010
They analyze data using their scientific power, and they make use of that to fight their battles.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:07.110
That's why we should send those who they have the least data on to battle.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:09.120
For example,

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:18.620
Takao is fighting the first match with his new Dragoon. As such, the PPB shouldn't have much data on it.

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:24.110
And for the same reason, Rei, who's fighting second, should be safe.

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:27.130
My Bey just got renewed, after all.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:33.170
As for you, Max, you've been using the same Beyblade for a long time.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:37.740
In other words, we should assume that they already know everything about it.

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:41.630
Sending you to fight in the finals would be dangerous!

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:47.830
That's why I think we should opt for Kai.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:52.630
They failed their attempt to gather data on him.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.210
I agree.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:57.880
What you say makes sense, Professor.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:58.790
Rei!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:01.960
It's the right choice if we're thinking about victory.

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:05.170
Well, that may be true, but still..!

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:08.110
This is the best way to go about it.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.210
I can't accept this! No way!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:16.480
I made a promise with my Mama! That I would fight against her team with all I've got!

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.480
I want her to look at me!

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:22.320
I... I am not going to break that promise!

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:24.660
Hey! Max!

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.200
<i>Aloha!</i>

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.540
How's this? I bought it at the souvenir shop downstairs.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.440
Don't I look American like this?

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:45.360
Swim, swim, how do you like that?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.090
Swim, swim, swim...

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:52.850
Uh? Why are you staring at me like that?

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:56.210
Come on! Even I will get embarrassed if you keep looking at me!

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:57.280
I'll go look for him!

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:00.560
Eh? What's going on, boys?

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:17.060
Who's there?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.880
Max!

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:25.370
Mama...

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:41.500
Las Vegas... A city created with huge finances and all sorts of technology.

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:45.320
In a sense, it's a symbol of America.

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:50.210
It gives me a distant, cold feeling. I just can't come to like this city.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:54.070
Tomorrow's the day.

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:55.520
Yeah.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:58.870
What set will you play in?

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:04.130
I... I don't know yet.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.110
I see.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:06.840
Max...

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:07.960
What?

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.960
I wish you would avoid fighting tomorrow.

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:17.950
Speaking frankly, there's no competition between the BBA and PPB.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:21.830
If you fight, you <i>will</i> suffer an unsightly defeat.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:25.170
So, I'd rather you not fight.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.660
No way.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:29.540
I want to fight.

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:30.940
If I don't...

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:33.180
If I don't fight...

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.050
Max?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.200
You won't look at me.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:42.190
What do you mean?

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:45.880
We talked on the phone plenty of times, and we emailed each other too!

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:50.640
I like how you're always
focused on your research. But...

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:56.190
Even when I was in Japan and you were here in America, I wanted to feel close to you.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:59.600
But now that I'm here, I've invisible to you!

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:03.800
Oh, there he is.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:08.640
That's why I have to fight!
Mama, I want you to understand!

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:12.900
I... I <i>am</i> here!

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:17.430
So I <i>will</i> fight in the finals!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:22.200
You can't win against our
technical power with your skills.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.410
You can't be sure about that.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.280
Takao!

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:31.000
We have the heart. We care for our Beys and think of our friends.

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:37.050
As long as we have that, we will never lose to the PPB, who can only speak of science and technique!

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:39.300
Am I right, Max?

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:41.690
Yeah.

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:45.690
You sure say some nice things, Takao.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.910
Rei, Professor.

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.390
Do as you please.

00:09:57.390 --> 00:10:01.880
But during tomorrow's finals, you will understand.

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:03.360
If you fight.

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:13.270
Professor.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:13.970
Yes?

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:17.220
No matter what, I will keep asking you.

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:20.960
I want to fight in tomorrow's third battle.

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:22.990
Let Max fight.

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:24.390
Kai!

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:28.760
To me this American tournament is worthless.

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:31.780
But, this is..!

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:35.010
Kai, were you listening to them just now..?

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:39.280
I have no intention of fighting. Let Max do it.

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.830
Professor!

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:49.170
Very well. Max will fight!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.940
- Stop it!
- Thank you, Professor! I'm really grateful!

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.300
Are you happy, Max?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:56.200
Yeah!

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:05.480
Looks like they came together in the end.

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:08.180
I recognize you, have we met somewhere..?

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.880
I was at the research center.

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:12.560
I'm Takao's grandfather.

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:16.230
I think you'd better not underestimate them now.

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.000
If you'll excuse me.

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:28.000
Alright, we will win no matter what!

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:32.450
Let's show those guys our true power! Okay?

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:33.460
Yeah!

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:03.050
<i>Ladies and gentlemen!</i>

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:04.530
We're at the finals at last!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.150
Who will conquer the American tournament?

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:08.170
BBA?

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:09.310
PPB?

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:11.530
The day has finally come!

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:15.280
The finals will be fought in three matches.

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:19.560
Each player will fight three rounds. The first to win twice will take the victory.

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:24.560
Today the true skills of
these Bladers will be put to test!

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:29.190
Are you ready to cheer on them?

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:31.560
<i>It's showtime!</i>

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.560
The fierce battles are about to begin!

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:41.380
May the best team win.

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:45.500
I agree. I hope we
will see a spectacular fight.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.640
I hope so too.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:03.310
Oh? Seems like those two are pretty fired up, too.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:09.040
Takao, boys, give everything you have in this fight.

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:11.060
Alright!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.340
I'm going!

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:13.170
Yeah.

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.610
Fight, Takao!

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:15.720
We're in your hands!

00:13:16.140 --> 00:13:18.560
Let's start the first battle then!

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:22.080
For the BBA team, Takao!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.320
For the PPB team Steve!

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.580
Just you wait, PPB team.

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:46.330
Well then, let's reveal the Bey stadium!

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:54.450
The stadium for the first match is filled with skyscrapers!

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:59.900
Based on the metropolis New York, everywhere you look, you'll see tall buildings!

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:07.040
This will get in the way of the Bey's smooth movements. Precision and technique will be necessary!

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:12.160
What kind of match will take place here?

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:14.450
I can't wait to find out!

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:16.910
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:27.810
Three, Two, One!

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:30.300
Go... Shoot!

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:44.240
Oh! They're clashing together right off the bat!

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:45.700
Neither of them is giving up!

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:48.120
But who is going to come out victorious?

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:53.950
Dragoon!

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:58.840
That was close!

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:08.250
Okay! You're doing good, Dragoon.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.510
But something feels off...

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:15.650
I thought Tryhorn was much more powerful than this.

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:22.300
Tryhorn has the devastating Death Rush, so why isn't he using it?

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.420
That's the move that took you out, tight?

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:32.290
The power of the Death Rush comes from the head-on charge like that of a bison herd.

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:37.130
If it gets hit by that, even
Dragoon won't come out unscathed.

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:38.260
Indeed.

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.530
But...

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:44.570
Alright, let's try something.

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:52.220
Okay! Just as planned!

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:58.100
Think about this. This stadium has a countless number of obstacles, the buildings.

00:16:01.820 --> 00:16:03.000
In other words...

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:08.000
I see!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:12.570
There's no space for it to gain the acceleration needed to perform the Death Rush!

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:16.150
On the other hand, Dragoon
has unparalleled mobility.

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:20.820
Which means that this place is definitely advantageous for Takao!

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:22.080
That's correct!

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:29.260
Tryhorn unable to perform its Death Rush is like a bison without its horns.

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:32.880
Go!

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:44.180
Alright!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:51.080
Yahoo!

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:53.140
You did it, Takao!

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:55.330
Yeah! Did you see that, Max?

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:55.840
Yes!

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.870
We can win the finals!

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.150
We can do this!

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:00.320
Yes!

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:06.380
Maybe I held back too much.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:09.460
Dang right you did, you even lost.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.990
It's not that bad.

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:14.880
So, how is it, Director? Was it good enough?

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.140
It's more than enough.

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:19.640
We have gathered considerable data on the new Dragoon.

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:27.400
Is that so. Then I can go
all out from now on, right?

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.700
Yes, of course.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.950
Let's continue with the second set!

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:37.990
Will Takao win this set too?

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:40.700
Or will Steve be the winner this time?

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:43.320
It's going to be a tense battle!

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:45.020
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:48.250
Okay! This match is mine!

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:52.040
Three, Two, One!

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.550
Go... Shoot!

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.680
We'll go with the same strategy!

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:16.440
Okay!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.520
No way! How can it reach that kind of seed?!

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:29.920
And look at those movements!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:33.920
Looks like he thought the
same strategy would work again.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.890
Poor Steve is being taken lightly.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:44.410
Did you forget about the fact that I'm an American football player?

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:45.600
So what?!

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:49.880
American football is not just about charging head-on.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:54.650
In some cases, it may become  necessary to move swiftly in zigzag.

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:59.640
These buildings don't compare to the obstacles created by the opposing players during a game.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.800
Where is this power coming from?!

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.690
Are you telling me Tryhorn wasn't going all out earlier?!

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:20.480
That's right.

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:23.710
We wanted some data on Dragoon, so...

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:28.010
The one earlier was a sort of... Yes, it was a test match.

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:30.080
What did you just say?!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:34.730
Oh! Tryhorn keeps attacking! Dragoon can't do anything to counter!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:38.420
To think he still had this kind of ability hidden..!

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:39.660
I can't believe this.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:43.650
This... is the power of the PPB!

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:47.500
The engineering of the development team...

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:50.670
The natural talent that Steve has for American football...

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.640
They come to life in that
power and those movements.

00:19:54.640 --> 00:19:58.230
You have no way to respond to that.

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:01.200
But my Dragoon won't lose when it comes to power..!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.150
Here it is!

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:14.110
This is fine.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.610
Here comes the touchdown!

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:31.550
The second set ends with Steve's victory!

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.600
No way!

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:43.070
How..? How could this happen?!

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:45.540
This was a total defeat...

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:47.030
No, not yet.

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:50.520
Takao can... Takao can surely make it..!

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:59.300
We're still tied. The score is not settled yet!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.080
The real fight starts now!

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:09.490
It's useless. We've already analyzed your emotions, Dragoon's stats, everything.

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:15.510
They will never ever be able
to win against us, the PPB.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:21.000
The goddess of victory will shine upon us.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:55.020 --> 00:22:57.840
Preview

00:22:57.840 --> 00:23:01.350
